## Decision honesty
**FIXED path-A for R2 Multi-Import Type Check:**

Multiple modules load through `load_import` and typecheck on product host
`ooda/oodac/oodac` without crash. Cross-file calls, struct types across
import, arg-type mismatch fail-closed, and missing-import fail-closed are
live-proved by the DE smoke (exit 0).

**Still not claimed (do not greenwash):**

| Residual | Status |
|----------|--------|
| **Issue #9** expanded-stream LINE:COL after concat (not per-file local) | open — honesty residual |
| **Issue #10** duplicate free-names across imports still accept | open — xfail residual |
| **AUDIT_RESIDUAL R4/R5** full expanded `check` on oodac-scale trees timeout/hang | open — scale residual (not tiny multi) |
| Empty `import ""` may parse as non-import → OK | residual (security notes) |
| Some return-type / call-result annotation silent accepts | broader TC residual (also single-file) |
| `typecheck_bug_rails` if_field fail rails still red | out of R2 scope |
| Full pure multi tip rebuild (`seed_pure_multi`) | SKIP this pass (policy) |
| Per-module incremental check product path | residual (ideas only) |

Path-A multi-import TC ≠ oodac self-check without `PURE_SKIP_CHECK`.
Cap preferred style: smoke green + named residual = FIXED path-A.

